WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.536 --> 00:00:03.119
(guitar music)

00:00:06.207 --> 00:00:08.367
- [Cassandro] In the dressing
room something happens

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.367
while I'm getting ready.

00:00:11.422 --> 00:00:13.691
Once I start putting my makeup on,

00:00:13.691 --> 00:00:15.441
I turn from this male

00:00:16.597 --> 00:00:17.430
to female.

00:00:18.853 --> 00:00:21.103
And that is amazing for me.

00:00:25.247 --> 00:00:27.997
(crowd cheering)

00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:33.899
My name is Cassandro El Exótico.

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:35.531
I am a professional wrestler;

00:00:35.531 --> 00:00:38.281
I've been wrestling for 28 years.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.951
I'm an Exótico Luchador,
which is a flamboyant,

00:00:42.951 --> 00:00:45.701
a wrestler with glamour and style.

00:00:46.927 --> 00:00:50.677
(crowd chanting "Cassandro")

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:53.916
(cheering)

00:00:55.219 --> 00:00:57.719
I always knew I was different.

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:01.233
I remember when I was in second grade,

00:01:01.233 --> 00:01:03.857
I think I was like seven
or eight years old.

00:01:03.857 --> 00:01:06.274
And I already knew I was gay.

00:01:07.712 --> 00:01:10.648
I was taught that I couldn't be gay,

00:01:10.648 --> 00:01:13.607
I couldn't act this way,
I couldn't dress this way,

00:01:13.607 --> 00:01:14.775
I couldn't talk this way

00:01:14.775 --> 00:01:18.007
because I was going to burn in Hell.

00:01:18.007 --> 00:01:20.539
When I was first called to be an Exótico

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:22.789
I was like, "Wow, freedom."

00:01:23.743 --> 00:01:26.831
This weight that I'd
been carrying for years

00:01:26.831 --> 00:01:28.801
was just like melted down.

00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:31.968
Rhinestones, rhinestones, rhinestones.

00:01:33.142 --> 00:01:34.958
Glow in the dark.

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:39.195
I started using the pantyhose, the makeup,

00:01:39.195 --> 00:01:40.695
the bathing suits,

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:46.223
rhinestones, feathers,
and boas and all that

00:01:46.223 --> 00:01:48.199
because I wanted to be different.

00:01:48.199 --> 00:01:50.927
And that was the scariest moment,

00:01:50.927 --> 00:01:53.486
but when I saw the audience and the fans,

00:01:53.486 --> 00:01:54.816
how they took me in,

00:01:54.816 --> 00:01:58.899
they were just like "Wow,
look at him, her, she."

00:02:00.535 --> 00:02:02.785
I feel like a woman inside.

00:02:04.417 --> 00:02:07.479
And then it's like this is me.

00:02:07.479 --> 00:02:10.562
And that transformation is beautiful.

00:02:13.438 --> 00:02:15.326
Something happens when I get out

00:02:15.326 --> 00:02:18.447
of the dressing room to the ring.

00:02:18.447 --> 00:02:22.418
I'm still looking like a
woman, I'm looking flamboyant,

00:02:22.418 --> 00:02:24.751
and then once I step in the ring,

00:02:24.751 --> 00:02:26.502
my macho side kicks in

00:02:26.502 --> 00:02:28.610
and I'm like "You gotta
be ready for the fight."

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.860
(slapping)

00:02:32.111 --> 00:02:34.262
(yelling)

00:02:34.262 --> 00:02:37.260
All my title matches and
mostly all of my matches

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.355
has been against men.

00:02:39.355 --> 00:02:42.355
Masked men, machista's, homophobics,

00:02:43.339 --> 00:02:46.871
and I vow always being true to myself.

00:02:46.871 --> 00:02:49.511
It's lucha libre, not a beauty parlor.

00:02:49.511 --> 00:02:53.079
Even though it looks like it sometimes.

00:02:53.079 --> 00:02:55.288
Today I can tell you

00:02:55.288 --> 00:02:56.455
that being gay

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:00.053
has been a gift from God to me.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:03.514
And I understand that.

00:03:05.249 --> 00:03:08.080
So that's why lucha libre has always been

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.580
one of my biggest medications.

00:03:13.391 --> 00:03:16.831
I don't think I will
ever leave lucha libre.

00:03:16.831 --> 00:03:19.374
This is what I've done all my life.

00:03:19.374 --> 00:03:22.124
(crowd cheering)

